### PayPulse S0 — login (demo)
POST http://localhost:8090/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### Create payment (via gateway, replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "accountId": "acc-demo-1",
  "amount": 99.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "merchantId": "merchant-demo"
}

### Create payment (direct to payment-command, no JWT — local dev only)
POST http://localhost:8086/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "acc-direct",
  "amount": 10.00,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Query current balance (S1 read-side via gateway)
GET http://localhost:8090/api/v1/accounts/acc-demo-1/balance?currency=USD
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Query temporal balance (S1 read-side via gateway)
GET http://localhost:8090/api/v1/accounts/acc-demo-1/balance?currency=USD&at=2099-01-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
